    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nirih\u00a0</strong>is a time-attack game like no other. <br> It blends fast, agile movement in free fall, <br>intense battles against creatures from other worlds,<br> and a thrilling sense of speed and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST-PACED GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/4d96edf00c7746d2a4fbe7a3953fbb7e.poster.avif?t=1755182497\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/4d96edf00c7746d2a4fbe7a3953fbb7e.webm?t=1755182497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your sprint and precise controls to reach your goal as quickly as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use spirit portals to gain speed and unleash spectral energy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DANGEROUS WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/1e9c7383e3455cb64da43d44e8df098b.poster.avif?t=1755182497\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291700/extras/1e9c7383e3455cb64da43d44e8df098b.webm?t=1755182497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to your advantage and stay clear of deadly hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to restore your spectral energy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACHIEVE THE BEST 